00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:46.500
What is this?

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.120
a

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.520
a fan [chocolate rain] sei?!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.180
Is that what they're calling Isekai that's Isekai nowadays?

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:52.660
You know, I would be more excited for

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:53.760
*Title on lower-left corner*

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:58.420
but it's been so long and so many fantasy dungeon-calling RPG-type Animes have come out since then

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:00.980
that I barely remember anything that happened,

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:03.940
but, can we just appreciate for a moment that this first arc

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:08.480
essentially revolves around a war that got started because someone insuted a waifu?

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:09.820
