00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.400
The boys are all likeable,

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.900
and it seems like a proper, Goddamn music Anime

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.340
which is totally my jam!

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:45.520
But, from this point on.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:48.300
can we just all agree to call it by its proper name,

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.140
Remember this wimpy kid?

