Welp,

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:01.220
looks like we've got another FATE/ spinoff to add to the

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:01.880
meager

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:02.740
list of

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:03.320
FATE/

