00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.680
It's just CSI: London with magic

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:12.420
where the gang solves different murder case every week.

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.960
And hey! There's no Holy Grail War

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:17.800
so we don't have another Saber clones added to the ridiculous large pile-

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.460
Peter Griffin:"Aw crap."

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:25.080
Peter Griffin:"Well one of us is gonna have to change."

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:31.880
There are a handful of manga that are out there in legendary status that have never been adapted

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.460
and, until this season,

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:34.240
^
Title  |  here

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:34.920
was one of them.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:38.620
This stands as one of the most critically-acclaimed Seinen manga of all time,

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:42.980
and I'm happy to say that Studio Wit seem to be giving it an amazing treatment it deserves.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:45.500
Of course, everyone's going to point of the big fight scenes

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:49.200
but equal care and attention has been given to the beautiful, quieter scenes,

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:52.900
and, if you listen really carefully they added a really nice touch.

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:56.880
*Yes there is sound in this part, just listen very closely*

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.360
You can just about hear the salty tears of Berserk and Kingdom fans.

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.420
It's not a series that will explode onto the scene,

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:06.880
but gradually builds itself up to a master-class of storytelling.

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:10.600
I can't even begin to fit the many layers of this tale into a short paragraph,

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:15.800
but this first arc in Vinland Saga to me is right up there with the Golden Age Arc from Berserk

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:20.880
and if this adaptation continues this quality, it'll easily be a contender for Anime of the Year.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.640
Day 1,000 of the Isekai invasion.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:26.800
I can't tell what is Isekai and what isn't anymore.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.120
I think I've... seen this before...

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.240
Is this How Not to Summon a Demon Lord?

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.580
Is this Re:Zero?

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.520
REM?!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:34.340
IS THAT YOU?!

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:34.840
(Who's Rem?)

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.340
I can't tell anymore!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:38.340
Isekai has fried my brain!

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.780
All I see are the same gaming interfaces,

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.240
the same medieval towns,

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.100
the same edgy protagonists,

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:45.460
I think i̷'̶m̷ g̸͚͖͓̈͒͜r̵͉͋ŏ̸̼̟͚̱̈͝w̷̢̡̺͍̻̔͒̊ĭ̸̭̪͉̍̃̐n̶̜̯̞̮͑̍́͝g̴̡̬̟̺̭̈͌̚ m̴̹̤̟̱̓̇͛͑͋͘ä̵̗͓͖̙́́̑̑̑̀͜ͅd̶͉̖̊̓͗̅͒͒!̶̤͌̆̋̀͗͘ͅ

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.520
Maybe all of this summer was an Isekai Anime!

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:49.760
Is this an Isekai?!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.340
IS THAT AN ISEKAI?!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.160
WHAT DOES IT ALL MEAN?!!!!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:56.700
Wait a minute...

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:57.880
I get it now.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.280
This was all a test.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.600
The Isekai gods are testing me!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.500
Vinland Saga

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.660
Fire Force

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.920
These aren't Anime of the Season!

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:10.560
How can they be when there's no one being transported to another world?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.420
This was never about vikings

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.680
or firefighters

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:14.760
or cute girls

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:19.040
when the ultimate evolution of Anime was right in front of our eyes.

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.020
